---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { PUBLISHER } from '../../lib/schema';

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'WebPage',
    name: 'Terms of Use',
    description: 'Terms of Use for pickyourrow.com, a website owned and operated by Joshua Israel Ventures LLC.',
    url: 'https://pickyourrow.com/terms/',
    publisher: PUBLISHER,
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://pickyourrow.com/' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Terms of Use', item: 'https://pickyourrow.com/terms/' },
    ],
  },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of Use for pickyourrow.com. Pick Your Row is owned and operated by Joshua Israel Ventures LLC. General information only. Always confirm seats with your airline."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Terms of Use</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      These terms govern your use of pickyourrow.com. By using the site you agree to them. If you do not agree,
      please do not use the site.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">Last updated 8 October 2026.</p>

    <h2>Who you are dealing with</h2>
    <p>
      Pick Your Row is a brand owned and operated by Joshua Israel Ventures LLC. It is not a separate company.
      When these terms say "we", "us" or "our", they mean Joshua Israel Ventures LLC. Your agreement under these
      terms is with Joshua Israel Ventures LLC.
    </p>

    <h2>General information only</h2>
    <p>
      Everything on this site, including seat maps, seat scores, best seat picks and guides, is general information
      for planning. It is not professional travel, legal or financial advice, and it is not advice from any airline.
      Seat scores and picks are editorial opinions.
    </p>

    <h2>Seat maps can differ from the real aircraft</h2>
    <p>
      Our seat maps are original illustrations of typical cabin layouts. The aircraft an airline actually operates on
      your flight can have a different layout, seat count, row numbering or features, and airlines can swap aircraft
      at short notice. Always confirm your seat and aircraft with the airline before you book, pay for a seat or fly.
    </p>

    <h2>Not affiliated with any airline</h2>
    <p>
      Airline names and aircraft names appear only to describe the content. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by
      or sponsored by any airline or aircraft manufacturer.
    </p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <ul class="clean">
      <li>Use the site only for lawful, personal and informational purposes.</li>
      <li>Do not try to disrupt the site, get around its security or overload it.</li>
      <li>Do not copy or republish our original seat map illustrations or text in bulk without written permission.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The Pick Your Row name, the original seat map illustrations, text and site design are owned by
      Joshua Israel Ventures LLC unless stated otherwise. Airline names and trademarks belong to their owners.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      The site links to airline, government and other outside websites. We do not control them and are not
      responsible for their content, accuracy or practices.
    </p>

    <h2>Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
    <p>
      The site and all content are provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, express or
      implied, including any warranties of accuracy, completeness, fitness for a particular purpose,
      merchantability or non infringement. We do not promise that the site will be available, error free or
      up to date.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent the law allows, Joshua Israel Ventures LLC and its members, managers and contractors are
      not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages, or for any loss of money,
      fares, seat fees, travel time or data, arising from your use of the site or your reliance on its content. Where
      liability cannot be excluded, it is limited to the greater of the amount you paid us to use the site, if any,
      or 100 US dollars. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under applicable law.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida, United States, without regard to its conflict of
      law rules. Any dispute arising from these terms or this site will be heard in the state or federal courts located in
      Florida.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows the latest version. Continuing to use the
      site after a change means you accept the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms: email <a href="mailto:joshuaofisrael@gmail.com">joshuaofisrael@gmail.com</a> or use
      the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>. See also our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>,
      <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a> and <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate disclosure</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
